{"type":"entry_appended","entry":{"type":"message","message":{"role":"system","sections":{"preamble":"You are ama, a coding agent working in the user's project through tools. Read files before changing them, make focused changes, and verify your work. Be concise.","tools":"Available tools:\n- bash: run shell commands (AMA_* env vars describe the session)\n- edit: replace text in a file\n- glob: find files by name pattern\n- grep: search file contents\n- read: read files (text or images)\n- todo: track multi-step work\n- write: create or overwrite a whole file (read existing files first)","cwd":"Current working directory: <root>/work"},"timestamp":0,"toolsAdded":[{"name":"bash","description":"Run a shell command. stdout+stderr combined; over 2000 lines or 50 KB keeps the tail and saves the full output to a file. Timeout default 120000 ms, max 600000 ms.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"command":{"type":"string"},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer"},"cwd":{"type":"string","description":"Default: session cwd"},"description":{"type":"string","description":"What this does, briefly"}},"required":["command"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"edit","description":"Replace text in a file (read it first). Each oldText must be unique in the original (unless replaceAll); edits must not overlap.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"edits":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"oldText":{"type":"string","description":"Exact text to replace"},"newText":{"type":"string"}},"required":["oldText","newText"],"additionalProperties":false}},"replaceAll":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["path","edits"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"glob","description":"Find files by glob (`**`, `*`, `?`, `[...]`, `{a,b}`, leading `!` excludes). Patterns without `/` match names at any depth. Respects .gitignore/.ignore; newest first.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string","description":"e.g. **/*.ts"},"path":{"type":"string","description":"Directory (default: cwd)"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Default 1000"}},"required":["pattern"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"grep","description":"Search file contents by JS regex. Respects .gitignore/.ignore; skips binary and >2 MB files. Output: `path:line: text`.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string","description":"File or dir (default: cwd)"},"glob":{"type":"string","description":"File filter, e.g. *.ts"},"ignoreCase":{"type":"boolean"},"literal":{"type":"boolean"},"context":{"type":"integer","description":"0-5 lines"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Default 100"}},"required":["pattern"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"read","description":"Read a file. Text comes with line numbers (cat -n), limited to 2000 lines or 50.0 KB; page with offset/limit. Images (png, jpg, gif, webp) come as attachments.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Absolute or relative to cwd"},"offset":{"type":"integer","description":"First line (1-based)"},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Max lines"}},"required":["path"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"todo","description":"Session task list: `set` replaces all items, `update` changes items by id (only given fields), `get` reads.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["set","update","get"]},"items":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["pending","in_progress","done"]},"planStep":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"write","description":"Write a file, replacing its entire content; parent directories are created. An existing file must be read first. Prefer the edit tool for partial changes.","parameters":{"type":"object","